Hi Ashinakhan;

An asterisk in the "enhance"menu means you have enough use of the
weapon to advance a skill, but you don't have enough unused "skill
slots". You get a skill slot every time you gain an experience level;
you use them up advancing weapons/spells. You have already enhanced a
lot of skills, so you used up the skill slots you gained so far; you
need to gain one more experience level to advance dagger to skilled (it
takes two skill slots to go from basic to skilled, and three more to go
from skilled to expert).

